## Requirement, and what to do when it fails

Works only while the Claude desktop app is open **and that folder is connected to the
session**. Folder grants are per-session — in a new session KHAM must add the folder again
("Add folder" in the desktop app). If `mcp__remote-devices__*` is missing or erroring, fall
back to `SendUserFile` alone, say the folder isn't reachable, and don't retry in a loop.

